      "id": "neoplasm_template",
      "label": "Neoplasm: report on the QMH appendix cancer template",
      "text": "An appendiceal neoplasm is present in {parts}. Grading, depth of invasion, margin status and staging should be reported on the QMH appendix cancer template; a supplementary synoptic report will follow.",
