        "field": "neoplasia",
        "not": "No dysplasia or malignancy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "granulomas",
      "label": "Granulomas: differential",
      "text": "Granulomas are present in {parts}. The differential includes interval appendicitis, Crohn's disease, infection (including Yersinia and mycobacteria) and sarcoidosis; correlation with the clinical history and, where indicated, special stains for organisms is recommended.",
